<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices -March 18.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices -March 18.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    93/95     99/101     UNQ     205/213</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   95/98    101/104   198/203   210/215</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker prices held steady on Tuesday in line with recent cargo strength but talks were thin, traders said. Despite the slightly weaker crude values, traders were not pessmistic. &quot;Cargo is strong and if crude rebounds, bunker offers will definitely go up,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
</text>
